{"id": "t150-004", "text": "Milan is really into vinyl at the moment, mostly old jazz and Blue Note pressings he finds at car boot sales. He's been complaining that half of them crackle, and he keeps saying he wants a decent record cleaner but won't buy one himself. His birthday is the week after next, so that's the present sorted. He also likes those dark chocolate gingers from the deli.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old jazz", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Blue Note pressings", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a decent record cleaner", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after next", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dark chocolate gingers from the deli", "owner": "p1"}]}
