{"id": "t150-033", "text": "Milan Petrov, the new neighbour at number 12, is a chef at the Italian on the high street. He said to pop in for a free tiramisu sometime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan Petrov", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "neighbour at number 12", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chef at the Italian on the high street", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime"}]}
{"id": "t150-034", "text": "Remind me to text Joy good luck the night before her audition. It's next Wednesday at the Royal Northern.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Joy good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t150-035", "text": "Marcus can't do dairy at all, it makes him really ill. Joanna says hard cheese is fine though, oddly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do dairy", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joanna", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard cheese is fine", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-036", "text": "Bogdan mentioned his dad's 70th is on Sunday and the whole family is going for a big Romanian lunch. He's in charge of the sarmale.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big Romanian lunch", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t150-037", "text": "Gym, then groceries, then finish the tax return. Must do it before Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the tax return", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t150-038", "text": "Chidi said his sister Demi just had a baby girl last night! Both doing well. Buy a card and something small for the baby this weekend, and maybe drop round a meal a week after once they've settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby girl", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Buy a card and something small for the baby", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round a meal", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after once they've settled", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-039", "text": "Talked to Lila about her new allotment. She's growing chillies and wants to make her own hot sauce. A set of nice bottles and labels could be a good Christmas present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allotment", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "growing chillies", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to make her own hot sauce", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "set of nice bottles and labels could be a good Christmas present", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-040", "text": "Bumped into Ibrahim and his wife at the market on Saturday. They're expecting twins in March! He's thrilled and slightly terrified, and she's had awful morning sickness, can barely keep anything down except ginger biscuits and plain rice. They're also trying to move to a bigger flat before the babies arrive. Maybe I could help with packing the weekend they move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly terrified", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "morning sickness", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to a bigger flat", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the babies arrive", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "help with packing", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend they move", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-041", "text": "Akira hates surprises, so absolutely no surprise party for his birthday on the 22nd. He'd much rather a quiet ramen dinner with a few of us, Seo-yeon, Zhang and me probably. He doesn't eat pork, so it has to be the place with the chicken paitan. I need to book a table for that Friday and remind everyone the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprises", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet ramen dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book a table", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "remind everyone", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-042", "text": "Gareth's cat Bramble went missing on Tuesday. He's put posters up everywhere. Check with him tomorrow morning if she's turned up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Bramble", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check with him tomorrow morning if she's turned up", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-043", "text": "Mihai is vegetarian but eats fish. Prefers red wine, Pinot Noir especially.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats fish", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "red wine", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Pinot Noir", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-044", "text": "Seo-yeon's parents are visiting from Busan next week for ten days, their first time in the UK. She wants recommendations for a good Korean restaurant that isn't too touristy, plus somewhere her dad can get a proper Sunday roast because he's seen them on TV. Her mum doesn't eat red meat. Send her the list tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Busan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "ten days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat red meat", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "r3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her the list", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-045", "text": "Oliver's interview with the bank is on Thursday afternoon. Remind me to send him a good luck message that morning and call him the day after to hear how it went. He said the last one knocked his confidence, so be encouraging.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with the bank", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a good luck message", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-046", "text": "Kate is off sugar for a month. Don't bring brownies on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off sugar", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}]}
