{"id": "t150-049", "text": "Zhang mentioned he's been learning to make dumplings from his grandmother over video calls. He's proud of the pleats now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "make dumplings", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
