{"id": "t150-051", "text": "Eli loves anything to do with Formula 1. Big Ferrari fan, even though he complains about them constantly. Kate says he's been eyeing up a Lego Ferrari set for months but thinks it's too expensive to buy for himself. Could split it with Kate for his 30th in December. He also drinks an embarrassing amount of Irn-Bru.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ferrari", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eyeing up a Lego Ferrari set", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "split it with Kate", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Irn-Bru", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-052", "text": "Lunch with Malik went on longer than planned. His brother Ibrahim has his medical school interview a week on Monday, and their mum is apparently more nervous than he is. Malik wants to take him out for a curry the night before to keep him calm. I should send Ibrahim a quick message afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "medical school interview", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week on Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Ibrahim a quick message", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-053", "text": "Juan's daughter Lila graduated from Leeds yesterday. He sent about thirty photos. I must send congratulations to them both.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduated from Leeds", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send congratulations to them both", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
