{"id": "t150-058", "text": "Took the car in for its MOT. They'll call this afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MOT", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}]}
{"id": "t150-059", "text": "Nasser and his girlfriend split up last weekend. He's putting on a brave face but I could tell he's not okay. I'll take him for a coffee on Sunday. He also said he's thinking of moving back to Bristol after Christmas, near his parents, which honestly might help. Don't push him on it though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not okay", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Bristol", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-060", "text": "Spoke to Kate's mum briefly at the school gates. She's got her knee replacement on the 2nd and will be out of action for six weeks. Kate is going to cover the school runs and is already stretched thin. Offer to do Wednesdays for a bit, and remind me to drop round a lasagne the week after the operation.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "out of action", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stretched thin", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Offer to do Wednesdays", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round a lasagne", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
